WEBVTT

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:36.890 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.860 line:0%
[Episode 1]

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:48.050 line:0%
[Cang State Palace]

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.080 line:0%
Salute.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:53.200 line:0%
In the fifth year of the Yuanhe Era of Cang State,

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.600 line:0%
Emperor Wenzong Xiao Huan

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.440 line:0%
and the former Crown Prince died of disease successively.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:58.240 line:0%
[Zhou Xu, Empress Dowager of Cang State]

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.080 line:0%
Xiao Qi, grandson of the former emperor,

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:00.520 line:0%
who was still an infant, ascended the throne.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.830 line:0%
The era name was changed into Shengli.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.430 line:0%
The queen Zhou Xu, who had long been assisting in government affairs,

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.760 line:0%
was honored as the grand empress dowager.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.439 line:0%
She attended to state affairs

00:02:09.439 --> 00:02:12.170 line:0%
and became the most powerful person in the state.

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:18.530 line:0%
Long live the Emperor, long live the Emperor!

00:02:22.129 --> 00:02:24.190 line:0%
[Six years later]

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.690 line:0%
[Training Ground, Imperial Security Bureau]

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.160 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:12.710 line:0%
We were interrogating the suspects all night.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:13.980 line:0%
All of them have confessed to their crimes.

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:16.910 line:0%
But they refused to reveal the mastermind behind it.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.000 line:0%
White...

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.240 line:0%
White Ghost!

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:40.320 line:0%
White Ghost!

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.940 line:0%
[Shen Du, Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau]

00:04:46.959 --> 00:04:47.560 line:0%
I...

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:48.680 line:0%
I'll confess.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.540 line:0%
I only helped them transport the people.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.240 line:0%
There was a buyer in Jiannan

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:54.840 line:0%
who wanted a hundred children to be slaves.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:55.700 line:0%
Take them away.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:02.440 line:0%
Next time,

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.610 line:0%
don't wait for me to do this myself.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:07.360 line:0%
Yes.

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:11.980 line:0%
Let's go to the palace.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.920 line:0%
Mother, I heard that you were saddened

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.560 line:0%
by the death of the state preceptor

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.830 line:0%
and that you were not feeling well.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.670 line:0%
So I copied scriptures until dawn,

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:21.930 line:0%
[Xiao Zhong, Prince Xian]

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.840 line:0%
praying for your recovery.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.920 line:0%
It's so kind of you to do so.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:28.440 line:0%
I really appreciate it.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:27.980 line:0%
[Xiao Qi, the young emperor]

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.880 line:0%
Minister Zhang, you're being a wonderful teacher

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:32.120 line:0%
to him.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.650 line:0%
[Zhang Xingwei, prime minister]

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.280 line:0%
I'm flattered.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:36.600 line:0%
His Highness, Prince Xian,

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.040 line:0%
is a man of loyalty and filial piety

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.360 line:0%
and has a kind heart.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.020 line:0%
[Princess Ying, Princess Yong'an]

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:41.110 line:0%
He's born with a good nature.

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:46.320 line:0%
How come Lord Shen didn't come to court today?

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.600 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen is busy with his work

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:49.510 line:0%
[Lai Luozhi, Minister of Imperial Investigation Department]

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.400 line:0%
and has repeatedly achieved remarkable feats.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:52.200 line:0%
Perhaps

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:53.640 line:0%
[Xu Wan, Internal Officer]

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:54.000 line:0%
he has no time to attend court.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:11.120 line:0%
Shen Du, Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau, has arrived.

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.030 line:0%
Greetings, Your Royal Highness.

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:34.670 line:0%
Please rise, Lord Shen.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:38.800 line:0%
Your Royal Highness.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:39.680 line:0%
Just now, I was

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:40.280 line:0%
investigating the case

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.680 line:0%
of a hundred children who were missing.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:42.880 line:0%
All suspects have confessed.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:43.760 line:0%
I apologize for being late,

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.420 line:0%
and beg for your forgiveness,

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:46.880 line:0%
This case caused

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.360 line:0%
a lot of fear in the Xiang'an City.

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:51.560 line:0%
I really made a right decision

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.220 line:0%
to let you handle the case.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.200 line:0%
Lord Shen.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.959 line:0%
As it happens,

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.480 line:0%
early this morning, Minister Zhang

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.630 line:0%
requested a reward

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.040 line:0%
from me for you.

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:03.320 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.240 line:0%
always manages to turn the tide.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.880 line:0%
He is truly a model for all of us.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.800 line:0%
Thank you for your compliment, Minister Zhang.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.240 line:0%
It is the duty of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.360 line:0%
I require no reward.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.560 line:0%
Minister Zhang and the Imperial Security Bureau

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.080 line:0%
have always been at odds.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:16.400 line:0%
Have you

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:18.080 line:0%
buried the hatchet recently?

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.000 line:0%
Yong'an.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.030 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.560 line:0%
Seeing my officials are all on good terms,

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:31.520 line:0%
I feel I'm lucky to have you.

00:07:31.959 --> 00:07:32.920 line:0%
Lord Shen.

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.040 line:0%
Today,

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.440 line:0%
let me choose a wife for you.

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:38.880 line:0%
What do you think?

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:47.640 line:0%
White Ghost has always been at will.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:49.280 line:0%
Master, how did you know

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:53.520 line:0%
[East Side Hall]

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:50.600 line:0%
that he would agree to marry

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:52.120 line:0%
the girl chosen by the grand empress dowager?

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:53.800 line:0%
Shen Du is known as White Ghost

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.840 line:0%
To others, he's a brutal man who has killed lots of people.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:58.700 line:0%
But to the grand empress dowager,

00:07:58.760 --> 00:07:59.840 line:0%
he is no more than an official who hopes to

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:02.770 line:0%
rise through the ranks and win Her Highness's favor.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.720 line:0%
Is he afraid that if he says no

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:06.720 line:0%
to the marriage arrangement,

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.800 line:0%
he will lose the trust from the grand empress dowager?

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.800 line:0%
Even if you're a ghost,

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.880 line:0%
you would have human desires.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:25.320 line:0%
Xing.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.080 line:0%
-Xing.
-Xing.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.020 line:0%
-Morning, Xing.
-Xing.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:27.600 line:0%
Morning.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:28.720 line:0%
-Xing.
-Morning.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:32.120 line:0%
-Morning, Xing.
-Xing.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:32.640 line:0%
Morning.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:34.099 line:0%
Miss Yan, you're so early.

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:37.160 line:0%
Be careful.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.240 line:0%
I just dried these flower petals.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.080 line:0%
Be careful.

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:47.060 line:0%
[Yan Xing, a scribe in the Ministry of Justice]

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.000 line:0%
I'm sorry, Miss Yan.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:57.850 line:0%
It's alright.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.570 line:0%
-Morning, Yan Xing.
-Morning.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.040 line:0%
-Morning.
-Morning, Xing.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.240 line:0%
-Morning.
-Morning.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:10.150 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:33.080 line:0%
Didn't you

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.740 line:0%
have breakfast this morning?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.280 line:0%
How come you're so clumsy?

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.000 line:0%
You see?

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:38.920 line:0%
What can a woman do

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:39.640 line:0%
in the Ministry of Justice?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.920 line:0%
If what you said is heard

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.040 line:0%
by Officer Xu who's often with the grand empress dowager,

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.120 line:0%
you will be blamed for disrupting her plan

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.680 line:0%
to get women to work for the government.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:45.880 line:0%
Why do you have so much to say today?

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:46.880 line:0%
You have nothing to do, huh?

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:47.640 line:0%
Get to work.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.360 line:0%
File them.

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:56.840 line:0%
My Lord.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:11.240 line:0%
[Wu Taiming, a section chief of the Ministry of Justice]

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:12.600 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:14.310 line:0%
Get the tea.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:18.380 line:0%
My Lord.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.360 line:0%
Today,

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.400 line:0%
the constables

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.000 line:0%
gave us a case

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.480 line:0%
from Mount Yangui.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.120 line:0%
It's said a woman from a household

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:24.960 line:0%
met a ghost

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.360 line:0%
and hung herself.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:28.720 line:0%
My Lord, let me tell you.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:29.520 line:0%
My subordinates and I

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.560 line:0%
have an awful lot of trivial cases

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.640 line:0%
to deal with like this one.

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:32.880 line:0%
My bros and I

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:33.800 line:0%
don't even

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:34.720 line:0%
have time to eat,

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:35.650 line:0%
let alone sleep.

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.960 line:0%
I've made a request for more manpower

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.880 line:0%
from higher-ups.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:41.760 line:0%
Right.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:42.720 line:0%
Two years ago,

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:44.160 line:0%
we finally got to recruit a clerk.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:44.920 line:0%
But...

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.200 line:0%
It's a woman.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:54.520 line:0%
Take this.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:55.720 line:0%
When the constables

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:56.520 line:0%
finish their investigation and report back,

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:57.760 line:0%
just file it.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.080 line:0%
Don't complicate it.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:05.920 line:0%
Yes.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.810 line:0%
[My mother was hanging herself from a beam and when we got her down, she was not breathing.]

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.810 line:0%
[His husband Cheng suspected testimony and got up early to see his wife in the hall]

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.800 line:0%
Mount Yangui.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:16.630 line:0%
Suicide.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.880 line:0%
You people in the Xiang'an City pay little respect to the dead.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:20.680 line:0%
In my hometown,

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.520 line:0%
we wouldn't dare to hang colorful ribbons after a county magistrate died.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.280 line:0%
It's only been a month

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.360 line:0%
since the state preceptor died.

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:25.400 line:0%
But there are lanterns and decorations everywhere in the city.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:26.440 line:0%
People here seem not to care about his death.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.560 line:0%
You know nothing.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.360 line:0%
The state preceptor was

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.480 line:0%
a great sage who knew the will of heaven.

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:30.200 line:0%
He

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.360 line:0%
even prophesied the current

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:33.840 line:0%
grand empress dowager's reign.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:34.320 line:0%
Really?

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.480 line:0%
The place where he died was said to be a magical place.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:36.520 line:0%
Today, all officials are going to pay their respects there.

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:39.450 line:0%
Black Rakshasa is coming! Black Rakshasa is coming!

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:40.660 line:0%
Quick, run!

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.160 line:0%
Hide quickly!

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:45.640 line:0%
Who is it?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.200 line:0%
Why is everyone

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.800 line:0%
acting like they've seen a ghost?

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.800 line:0%
You didn't hear about Black Rakshasa?

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.400 line:0%
He established the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:52.840 line:0%
It specializes in espionage and inquisition by torture.

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.040 line:0%
It's said there are over a hundred

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:55.240 line:0%
torture devices in there.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.320 line:0%
Once one is brought in,

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.200 line:0%
they will confess.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.040 line:0%
If they refuse to confess,

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.280 line:0%
they'll be extremely painful.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.320 line:0%
White Ghost is here!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.560 line:0%
White Ghost is also here!

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:03.960 line:0%
So that isWhite Ghost.

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:04.800 line:0%
White Ghost

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:07.080 line:0%
is Grand Commander Shen of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.920 line:0%
Imperial Security Bureau is quite something.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:10.320 line:0%
It is directly managed by the grand empress dowager.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.000 line:0%
Investigation, surveillance, assassination;

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:12.680 line:0%
they do them all.

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:13.480 line:0%
Stop crying.

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:14.680 line:0%
White Ghost of the Underworld is here.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.680 line:0%
Wherever he goes,

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:17.580 line:0%
clouds scatter in broad daylight

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:20.160 line:0%
and children dare not cry.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:21.680 line:0%
The two lord's convoys

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:22.560 line:0%
are going to encounter.

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:24.360 line:0%
We'll have a great show to watch.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.720 line:0%
The street is only this wide.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.680 line:0%
Who do you think will make way?

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.680 line:0%
Who knows?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.680 line:0%
Let's see.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:30.320 line:0%
Stop.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.840 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, you're here after all.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:43.850 line:0%
I thought

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.920 line:0%
you'd be too busy preparing for your wedding

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:47.120 line:0%
and couldn't make it.

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:48.560 line:0%
My wedding

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:50.680 line:0%
is nothing compared to matters of the state.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.280 line:0%
Minister Zhang advised the marriage.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:54.210 line:0%
The grand empress dowager agreed.

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:55.920 line:0%
It shows your marriage affair

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.980 line:0%
is also a matter of great importance.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:01.120 line:0%
It's a pity

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.420 line:0%
that your previous fiancées

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.960 line:0%
were not so fortunate.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.240 line:0%
Lord Lai, you're joking.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.000 line:0%
The auspicious time is coming soon.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:21.720 line:0%
Let's hurry if we don't want to miss it.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.450 line:0%
This West Street is too narrow.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:24.520 line:0%
It can't even accommodate

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:26.440 line:0%
two convoys.

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:28.640 line:0%
Clear out everything blocking the way

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:29.760 line:0%
on both sides

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.760 line:0%
so the Investigation convoy and the Security convoy

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.360 line:0%
can go along at the same time.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.010 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:37.550 line:0%
Let's go.

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:51.280 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.480 line:0%
You've really kept me waiting.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:37.280 line:0%
Minister Zhang.

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:38.160 line:0%
Minister Zhang.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.360 line:0%
I'm sorry for being late.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.360 line:0%
You're not late.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:41.600 line:0%
In fact, you arrived at the perfect time.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:42.400 line:0%
Everyone.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.900 line:0%
Let's begin the ceremony.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.840 line:0%
The auspicious time has come.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.290 line:0%
Thank you, Miss Yan.

00:14:57.800 --> 00:14:58.760 line:0%
If you hadn't come,

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:00.110 line:0%
[Jiang Langxing, a constable]

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.080 line:0%
we wouldn't have been able to identify the real culprit.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:01.800 line:0%
You're welcome.

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:02.640 line:0%
Investing

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:04.300 line:0%
is part of the Ministry of Justice's responsibilities.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:04.800 line:0%
By the way,

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:05.320 line:0%
a few days ago,

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.600 line:0%
you asked us to help find

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:07.760 line:0%
herbs that can detect poison.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.120 line:0%
I've found where they are.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.280 line:0%
There are some on the mountain nearby.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:11.680 line:0%
How about you get in our carriage and go with us

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.340 line:0%
to the mountain and pick some?

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:14.400 line:0%
Don't bother.

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:15.560 line:0%
You should hurry back and report.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.160 line:0%
I'll go up the mountain to pick them myself.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:17.920 line:0%
Then

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:19.500 line:0%
I'll take my leave.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.020 line:0%
Till next time.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.240 line:0%
Today's blessing ceremony

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:44.080 line:0%
was successful thanks to

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.520 line:0%
Minister Zhang's organization.

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:46.560 line:0%
Next year, our Cang State

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.160 line:0%
will enjoy peace

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.210 line:0%
and prosperity

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.640 line:0%
as the state preceptor predicted.

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:51.840 line:0%
Today, all officials came to pray for blessings.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.040 line:0%
That's because Prince Xian

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.760 line:0%
visited a saint among the commoners

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.880 line:0%
and chose today as the auspicious time

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:59.200 line:0%
to solve problems for the grand empress dowager.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.240 line:0%
I was merely following orders

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:03.640 line:0%
and fulfilling my duty as Her Royal Highness's official.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:04.640 line:0%
Our Cang State

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:05.680 line:0%
has wise rulers and good officials.

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:07.080 line:0%
We subjects are fortunate to live

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:08.800 line:0%
in this prosperous era of peace and stability.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:11.000 line:0%
We're so lucky.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:11.840 line:0%
Indeed.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.030 line:0%
Indeed.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.120 line:0%
Assassin!

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:18.860 line:0%
Seal off the mountain!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:35.840 line:0%
Miss.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.440 line:0%
Are you gathering these leaves to make medicine?

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:41.240 line:0%
No.

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.080 line:0%
I want to use them for autopsy...

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:46.400 line:0%
Yes.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:49.040 line:0%
I want to use them to make medicine.

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.160 line:0%
How did you know?

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.710 line:0%
I could tell from the way you are dressed.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:01.110 line:0%
[Qi Yeyun]

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.520 line:0%
You're a physician, right?

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:05.520 line:0%
You can say so.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.000 line:0%
Here, take these.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.240 line:0%
I've gathered enough.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:12.629 line:0%
Ms. Zhang at the village entrance is ill.

00:17:12.629 --> 00:17:14.040 line:0%
I came to pick some for her.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:15.520 line:0%
The other day, the doctor said

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:17.520 line:0%
drinking it as tea would be helpful.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:18.800 line:0%
Then let me pay you.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:19.869 line:0%
Please don't.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.119 line:0%
I just picked them casually.

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:26.960 line:0%
Well, thank you then.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.120 line:0%
Miss.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.360 line:0%
My name is Qi Yeyun.

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.360 line:0%
What's your name?

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.320 line:0%
Are you heading down the mountain, Miss?

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.240 line:0%
Let me show you a shortcut.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.240 line:0%
It'll be quicker.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.400 line:0%
Stop! Stop!

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:43.080 line:0%
Today,

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.400 line:0%
no one can leave the mountain.

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:45.360 line:0%
What happened?

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:46.120 line:0%
I'm a scribe from the Ministry of Justice

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:46.920 line:0%
No more talk.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.000 line:0%
Go with us.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:49.480 line:0%
-Go!
-Go!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.240 line:0%
What's going on here?

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.440 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:56.680 line:0%
At the time of the incident,

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:00.080 line:0%
only these people were ion the mountain and they're all here.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:06.280 line:0%
On the day of the blessing ceremony at the Ming Hall,

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:07.000 line:0%
someone

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.690 line:0%
dared to attempt an assassination on a court official.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.800 line:0%
I luckily dodged the arrow.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.690 line:0%
But I lost one of my beloved subordinates.

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:16.440 line:0%
Today,

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:19.040 line:0%
I must kill the assassin!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:20.960 line:0%
Assassin?

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:23.140 line:0%
Who is the assassin?

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:25.680 line:0%
One of you is the assassin.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:27.840 line:0%
I advise the assassin

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.280 line:0%
to confess now.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.280 line:0%
Then

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:32.760 line:0%
I won't let you die in pain.

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.360 line:0%
If you dare not confess,

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.210 line:0%
you will still be found guilty.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.000 line:0%
In 30 minutes,

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.120 line:0%
if no one confesses,

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:42.520 line:0%
all of you will be killed.

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:56.080 line:0%
Wait.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:18:58.720 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.540 line:0%
I am Yan Xing, a scribe from the Ministry of Justice.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.400 line:0%
May I examine the dead body?

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:03.920 line:0%
Maybe I can find out

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:05.050 line:0%
who the assassin is.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:06.280 line:0%
Okay.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.370 line:0%
It's between 5 to 7 p.m. now.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.160 line:0%
The sun is in the west.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.890 line:0%
So the place where they shot...

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:32.800 line:0%
Well, little scribe.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.520 line:0%
Can you tell me

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.850 line:0%
who the assassin is now?

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.560 line:0%
I haven't yet determined

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.170 line:0%
who the assassin is.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:52.440 line:0%
However,

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.600 line:0%
the assassin shot from a long distance.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:55.640 line:0%
The sun is shining brightly today

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:57.400 line:0%
and it will make it difficult for them to aim.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.760 line:0%
So he must have been in

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.000 line:0%
a shaded area at the time of the assassination.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:02.040 line:0%
Considering the direction

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:02.960 line:0%
of the arrow,

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.240 line:0%
the best hiding spot

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.080 line:0%
is in a tree.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.080 line:0%
The assassin must have been in the woods

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:11.560 line:0%
high on the mountain in the northwest.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:12.530 line:0%
After the incident,

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:14.400 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department immediately sealed off the mountain.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.920 line:0%
Therefore, the people in other mountain ranges

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.750 line:0%
couldn't possibly be the assassin.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:18.670 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:19.640 line:0%
I implore you

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:20.800 line:0%
to release the innocent civilians

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:21.800 line:0%
first.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:22.520 line:0%
I have already made myself

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.040 line:0%
very clear.

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.080 line:0%
If you want me to release them,

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.920 line:0%
you have to find out who the assassin is first.

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:28.120 line:0%
You failed to do that.

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:29.850 line:0%
I'll just kill them all.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:35.200 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.080 line:0%
I have a more interesting idea.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:05.290 line:0%
Shooting the assassin to death

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:07.400 line:0%
is not intimidating enough.

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:12.610 line:0%
I have kept several fighting dogs.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.000 line:0%
Their ability to tear criminals apart

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.120 line:0%
is quite amazing.

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:18.600 line:0%
Why don't we let my dogs

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:19.800 line:0%
bite them?

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:22.960 line:0%
Although it might take more time,

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:23.680 line:0%
it's

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:28.260 line:0%
more entertaining, right?

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:30.320 line:0%
People call me Black Rakshasa.

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:31.560 line:0%
But it seems

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.080 line:0%
you're even more brutal than me.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:35.530 line:0%
You won.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:37.040 line:0%
Your idea is better.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:40.360 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:14.160 line:0%
Stop!

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:20.840 line:0%
Let them stop.

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:27.880 line:0%
Go away!

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:28.680 line:0%
Go away!

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:30.310 line:0%
Go away! Go away!

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:32.560 line:0%
One of them is the assassin.

00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:37.760 line:0%
The assassin must be

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:39.960 line:0%
someone with great strength and speed,

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:41.920 line:0%
and skilled at climbing.

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:48.840 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:50.560 line:0%
You should

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:53.440 line:0%
do something about them.

00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:54.640 line:0%
Let me think

00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:56.410 line:0%
what way of killing them

00:22:56.760 --> 00:22:58.120 line:0%
would suit them better.

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:05.320 line:0%
Lord Lai, I implore you

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:06.960 line:0%
to wait a while more.

00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:08.800 line:0%
Just give me a little more time,

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:09.600 line:0%
and I'll find

00:23:09.600 --> 00:23:10.760 line:0%
the one and only assassin.

00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:12.360 line:0%
I stake my life on it.

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:14.740 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:16.510 line:0%
How much time

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:19.480 line:0%
do you think I should give her?

00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:24.640 line:0%
Six hours.

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:26.920 line:0%
Six hours later,

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:29.490 line:0%
if you can't find who the real assassin is,

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:33.800 line:0%
you'll die with them.

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:37.500 line:0%
[Imperial Security Bureau]

00:23:41.200 --> 00:23:42.720 line:0%
Those who use bows and arrows

00:23:42.720 --> 00:23:45.450 line:0%
develop calluses in three places on their hands.

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:47.970 line:0%
This person only has calluses on his palm.

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:48.880 line:0%
Ruled out.

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:50.600 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:51.040 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:53.320 line:0%
Lai Luozhi is the one who wants to find the assassin.

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:54.120 line:0%
But he sent the suspects here

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:55.580 line:0%
and let us handle the case.

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:56.320 line:0%
He said

00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:58.320 line:0%
he wanted us to use the fighting dogs to punish them.

00:23:58.320 --> 00:23:59.120 line:0%
Do you think

00:23:59.360 --> 00:24:00.720 line:0%
there is a trap for us?

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:03.240 line:0%
What kind of trap could there be?

00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:04.360 line:0%
He's just certain

00:24:04.360 --> 00:24:07.090 line:0%
that little scribe can't find the real assassin.

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:09.360 line:0%
He doesn't want to kill anyone from the Ministry of Justice either

00:24:09.360 --> 00:24:10.800 line:0%
because he wants to avoid getting his hands dirty.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:12.440 line:0%
If he doesn't want to get his hands dirty,

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:13.000 line:0%
aren't you afraid

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:14.730 line:0%
there will be gossip about you?

00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:20.260 line:0%
I've already been the son of a guilty minister.

00:24:20.260 --> 00:24:22.200 line:0%
I'm not afraid of any rumors.

00:24:23.660 --> 00:24:25.040 line:0%
The assassin's location

00:24:25.040 --> 00:24:27.120 line:0%
is at the peak of the northwest mountain.

00:24:27.120 --> 00:24:28.320 line:0%
And that planted forest

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:29.320 line:0%
is a lacquer tree forest.

00:24:29.320 --> 00:24:30.720 line:0%
Someone touched the branches of a lacquer tree,

00:24:30.720 --> 00:24:32.560 line:0%
and broke out in rashes all over their body.

00:24:32.560 --> 00:24:33.400 line:0%
When the guards

00:24:33.400 --> 00:24:34.760 line:0%
caught the suspects during the day,

00:24:34.760 --> 00:24:36.320 line:0%
none of them had any rashes on their bodies.

00:24:36.320 --> 00:24:37.520 line:0%
Those with severe rashes

00:24:37.520 --> 00:24:38.040 line:0%
can be ruled out

00:24:38.040 --> 00:24:39.740 line:0%
as possibly hiding in the lacquer tree forest.

00:24:39.740 --> 00:24:41.000 line:0%
There is this person in the middle.

00:24:41.000 --> 00:24:41.760 line:0%
The mud on his shoes

00:24:41.760 --> 00:24:43.560 line:0%
is not from the lacquer tree forest.

00:24:43.560 --> 00:24:44.220 line:0%
Ruled out.

00:24:44.320 --> 00:24:45.440 line:0%
Once we find the weapon the assassin used,

00:24:45.440 --> 00:24:47.040 line:0%
we'll know who the killer is.

00:24:54.710 --> 00:24:56.040 line:0%
Why is it so bright?

00:25:25.160 --> 00:25:26.840 line:0%
Do you have any last words?

00:25:32.000 --> 00:25:33.720 line:0%
Six hours are almost up.

00:25:33.920 --> 00:25:36.580 line:0%
You still haven't found out who the assassin is.

00:25:36.720 --> 00:25:37.440 line:0%
When the Imperial Guards

00:25:37.440 --> 00:25:38.800 line:0%
found the weapon used by the assassin in the lacquer tree forest,

00:25:38.800 --> 00:25:39.480 line:0%
and we take a closer look at it,

00:25:39.480 --> 00:25:41.140 line:0%
-then...
-No need to explain.

00:25:41.960 --> 00:25:43.760 line:0%
You have no any more time to wait.

00:25:46.320 --> 00:25:47.850 line:0%
Even if you find the weapon,

00:25:48.760 --> 00:25:51.020 line:0%
you're not completely certain, are you?

00:25:51.160 --> 00:25:52.000 line:0%
Am I right?

00:25:52.330 --> 00:25:53.920 line:0%
Just because we're not completely certain,

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:54.880 line:0%
we shouldn't do it?

00:25:54.880 --> 00:25:56.080 line:0%
You're not completely certain,

00:25:56.080 --> 00:25:57.560 line:0%
but you staked your life.

00:25:58.360 --> 00:26:00.360 line:0%
So you're either extremely foolish

00:26:00.400 --> 00:26:02.400 line:0%
or have no self-respect.

00:26:10.680 --> 00:26:12.520 line:0%
I'll leave a letter then.

00:26:12.960 --> 00:26:14.040 line:0%
Please deliver it

00:26:14.640 --> 00:26:17.170 line:0%
to Dr. Yan's residence in the east of the city.

00:26:22.400 --> 00:26:23.640 line:0%
Take Miss Yan away.

00:26:23.760 --> 00:26:24.880 line:0%
Get her to be properly killed.

00:26:24.880 --> 00:26:25.410 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:26:26.920 --> 00:26:28.180 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:26:31.120 --> 00:26:32.640 line:0%
Do you really not know me?

00:26:37.600 --> 00:26:39.280 line:0%
Should I?

00:26:44.240 --> 00:26:44.840 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:26:44.840 --> 00:26:46.970 line:0%
The assassin's weapon has been found,

00:26:49.760 --> 00:26:51.520 line:0%
Just as Miss Yan guessed,

00:26:51.520 --> 00:26:55.080 line:0%
it was buried under the fallen leaves in the lacquer tree forest.

00:26:55.080 --> 00:26:57.140 line:0%
It seems Miss Yan is lucky this time.

00:26:57.560 --> 00:26:58.480 line:0%
The weapon

00:26:59.160 --> 00:27:00.960 line:0%
was found in the last minute.

00:27:01.120 --> 00:27:01.960 line:0%
By comparing the bow and arrow

00:27:01.960 --> 00:27:03.520 line:0%
with the calluses on the suspect's hands,

00:27:03.520 --> 00:27:05.800 line:0%
I can determine who the assassin is.

00:27:07.920 --> 00:27:09.720 line:0%
It seems I have good luck today.

00:27:10.560 --> 00:27:12.360 line:0%
I've come at just the right time.

00:27:14.830 --> 00:27:17.080 line:0%
Lord Lai, you came at the perfect timing.

00:27:17.080 --> 00:27:19.340 line:0%
I'm afraid it's not just because of luck.

00:27:21.880 --> 00:27:22.640 line:0%
The weapon was transported

00:27:22.640 --> 00:27:25.500 line:0%
from Mount Yangui to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:27:26.350 --> 00:27:27.240 line:0%
The news must have

00:27:27.240 --> 00:27:30.500 line:0%
reached the Imperial Investigation Department long ago.

00:27:30.960 --> 00:27:32.440 line:0%
The six hours are up.

00:27:32.760 --> 00:27:34.200 line:0%
Miss Yan, hurry up.

00:27:34.240 --> 00:27:35.760 line:0%
I'm very curious to see

00:27:36.360 --> 00:27:38.200 line:0%
who was so bold

00:27:38.840 --> 00:27:40.320 line:0%
to try to kill me.

00:27:47.400 --> 00:27:48.200 line:0%
Gentlemen.

00:27:48.440 --> 00:27:49.160 line:0%
Please

00:27:49.160 --> 00:27:50.640 line:0%
use the bow and arrow

00:27:50.640 --> 00:27:51.900 line:0%
as you normally would.

00:28:04.400 --> 00:28:06.160 line:0%
I think I know who the assassin is.

00:28:06.160 --> 00:28:07.640 line:0%
The calluses on both suspects from using the bow

00:28:07.640 --> 00:28:08.770 line:0%
are almost the same.

00:28:08.920 --> 00:28:10.600 line:0%
However, their calluses from preparing the arrow

00:28:10.600 --> 00:28:11.720 line:0%
are different.

00:28:14.680 --> 00:28:15.480 line:0%
One

00:28:16.360 --> 00:28:18.760 line:0%
has the calluses on the inside of his thumb,

00:28:19.200 --> 00:28:19.960 line:0%
indicating that he uses

00:28:19.960 --> 00:28:21.280 line:0%
the inside of his thumb to support the arrow.

00:28:21.280 --> 00:28:22.800 line:0%
This bow-holding technique

00:28:22.800 --> 00:28:24.400 line:0%
is known by skilled archers.

00:28:24.440 --> 00:28:26.240 line:0%
It is the slanted low-push method.

00:28:26.240 --> 00:28:27.900 line:0%
It lacks accuracy in archery.

00:28:27.920 --> 00:28:28.720 line:0%
The other one

00:28:28.720 --> 00:28:30.490 line:0%
has calluses on the place where the root of his thumb joins the root of the index finger,

00:28:30.490 --> 00:28:31.840 line:0%
which is the correct high-push method.

00:28:31.840 --> 00:28:33.640 line:0%
It's good for precise shooting.

00:28:34.320 --> 00:28:34.980 line:0%
Therefore,

00:28:36.560 --> 00:28:37.690 line:0%
the assassin is you.

00:28:42.980 --> 00:28:44.360 line:0%
Don't move! Don't move.

00:28:44.640 --> 00:28:45.880 line:0%
Step back! Step back!

00:28:45.880 --> 00:28:46.880 line:0%
Don't come near me!

00:28:46.880 --> 00:28:47.520 line:0%
Let me go!

00:28:47.520 --> 00:28:48.680 line:0%
Or I'll kill her!

00:28:48.880 --> 00:28:50.880 line:0%
Don't you realize where you are?

00:28:51.320 --> 00:28:53.000 line:0%
You think you can escape?

00:28:53.360 --> 00:28:55.240 line:0%
Tell me who's behind this.

00:28:56.040 --> 00:28:58.100 line:0%
And I might keep your dead body whole.

00:28:59.200 --> 00:29:00.320 line:0%
Release her now!

00:29:04.280 --> 00:29:06.210 line:0%
Since we've got all the evidences,

00:29:06.840 --> 00:29:08.570 line:0%
we don't need your confession.

00:29:09.400 --> 00:29:10.670 line:0%
Prepare to shoot.

00:29:10.760 --> 00:29:11.240 line:0%
You...

00:29:11.480 --> 00:29:13.140 line:0%
Are you going to shoot her too?

00:29:14.120 --> 00:29:16.720 line:0%
She's not one of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:29:17.520 --> 00:29:18.880 line:0%
She's a petty scribe

00:29:18.880 --> 00:29:19.880 line:0%
without any rank.

00:29:21.030 --> 00:29:22.080 line:0%
I'll lose nothing

00:29:22.080 --> 00:29:23.040 line:0%
if she dies.

00:29:23.040 --> 00:29:23.800 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:29:24.040 --> 00:29:25.520 line:0%
You heartless White Ghost.

00:29:25.520 --> 00:29:27.480 line:0%
How can you act as if human life is not worth a straw?

00:29:27.480 --> 00:29:29.160 line:0%
If you died with the suspect,

00:29:29.600 --> 00:29:31.330 line:0%
I'll consider you as a patriot.

00:29:35.920 --> 00:29:36.960 line:0%
As far as I know,

00:29:37.730 --> 00:29:39.790 line:0%
the salary of a scribe is very little.

00:29:39.920 --> 00:29:41.640 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice has always been

00:29:41.640 --> 00:29:45.570 line:0%
the one that gives the highest compensation among the six ministries.

00:29:46.080 --> 00:29:48.720 line:0%
Your parents will gain benefits from raising you.

00:29:48.720 --> 00:29:49.600 line:0%
Even if I become a ghost,

00:29:49.600 --> 00:29:51.000 line:0%
I won't let you off.

00:29:53.060 --> 00:29:54.190 line:0%
What a coincidence,

00:29:54.840 --> 00:29:57.120 line:0%
I'm not afraid

00:29:59.130 --> 00:30:01.320 line:0%
of ghosts at all.

00:30:07.360 --> 00:30:09.000 line:0%
Don't move! Don't move!

00:30:24.840 --> 00:30:25.640 line:0%
Thank you.

00:30:28.000 --> 00:30:29.060 line:0%
You're not stupid.

00:30:29.680 --> 00:30:31.440 line:0%
Since there's no way out,

00:30:32.080 --> 00:30:32.880 line:0%
alright then.

00:30:39.770 --> 00:30:40.400 line:0%
Tell me!

00:30:40.880 --> 00:30:42.360 line:0%
Who sent you to kill me?

00:30:43.320 --> 00:30:44.120 line:0%
It's...

00:30:47.040 --> 00:30:48.800 line:0%
It's him.

00:31:02.960 --> 00:31:04.220 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:31:04.840 --> 00:31:07.300 line:0%
No wonder you were in such a hurry to kill him.

00:31:07.880 --> 00:31:08.920 line:0%
Awesome.

00:31:09.120 --> 00:31:09.920 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:31:10.440 --> 00:31:11.280 line:0%
How can you believe the nonsense

00:31:11.280 --> 00:31:12.920 line:0%
of the assassin before he died?

00:31:12.920 --> 00:31:14.160 line:0%
That's ridiculous.

00:31:14.240 --> 00:31:15.280 line:0%
Who do you think you are?

00:31:15.280 --> 00:31:17.410 line:0%
How dare you speak to my lord like this!

00:31:22.660 --> 00:31:24.320 line:0%
Lord Lai, please think carefully.

00:31:24.320 --> 00:31:26.240 line:0%
If it's the grand commander who sent the killer,

00:31:26.240 --> 00:31:27.040 line:0%
why would the Imperial Security Bureau

00:31:27.040 --> 00:31:27.960 line:0%
bother to arrest so many people

00:31:27.960 --> 00:31:29.280 line:0%
and search for the assassin's weapon?

00:31:29.280 --> 00:31:32.410 line:0%
Wouldn't it have been better to kill them from the start?

00:31:33.560 --> 00:31:35.120 line:0%
I was just joking.

00:31:35.320 --> 00:31:37.580 line:0%
How could I believe you wanted to kill me?

00:31:37.680 --> 00:31:39.080 line:0%
Don't take it seriously.

00:31:39.960 --> 00:31:40.760 line:0%
I

00:31:44.590 --> 00:31:46.160 line:0%
never took it seriously.

00:31:51.330 --> 00:31:53.360 line:0%
Now that the culprit has been brought to justice,

00:31:53.360 --> 00:31:54.800 line:0%
I can rest easy.

00:31:54.920 --> 00:31:57.760 line:0%
It's not good for me to stay at the Imperial Security Bureau any longer.

00:31:57.760 --> 00:31:58.820 line:0%
I'll take my leave.

00:32:17.240 --> 00:32:19.080 line:0%
I failed in my duty to watch the suspect.

00:32:19.080 --> 00:32:21.080 line:0%
Please punish me, Grand Commander.

00:32:22.600 --> 00:32:24.000 line:0%
Let it go since he is dead.

00:32:28.080 --> 00:32:29.070 line:0%
You guys,

00:32:30.880 --> 00:32:31.960 line:0%
take Miss Yan

00:32:33.560 --> 00:32:35.160 line:0%
and others

00:32:37.040 --> 00:32:37.960 line:0%
out of here.

00:32:37.960 --> 00:32:38.680 line:0%
Yes.

00:33:03.480 --> 00:33:04.400 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:33:04.400 --> 00:33:05.640 line:0%
I noticed that the young female scribe

00:33:05.640 --> 00:33:06.760 line:0%
was staring at you the whole time.

00:33:06.760 --> 00:33:08.420 line:0%
She's not afraid of you at all.

00:33:08.920 --> 00:33:10.780 line:0%
What's so surprising about that?

00:33:10.880 --> 00:33:12.080 line:0%
In the Xiang'an City,

00:33:12.480 --> 00:33:13.840 line:0%
there're always so many boring women.

00:33:13.840 --> 00:33:14.600 line:0%
Indeed.

00:33:14.800 --> 00:33:15.760 line:0%
Your appearance

00:33:15.760 --> 00:33:16.800 line:0%
can indeed attract some

00:33:16.800 --> 00:33:18.610 line:0%
brainless women who like handsome guys.

00:33:18.610 --> 00:33:20.080 line:0%
If you dare to talk nonsense again,

00:33:20.080 --> 00:33:22.520 line:0%
I'll send you to work at the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:33:22.520 --> 00:33:23.400 line:0%
Please don't!

00:33:23.440 --> 00:33:24.360 line:0%
I just want to work for the Imperial Security Bureau

00:33:24.360 --> 00:33:25.690 line:0%
for the rest of his life.

00:33:27.960 --> 00:33:28.980 line:0%
I got it.

00:33:29.120 --> 00:33:30.360 line:0%
The lady Yan Caiwei you're going to marry

00:33:30.360 --> 00:33:31.760 line:0%
is from Dr. Yan's family.

00:33:31.840 --> 00:33:32.920 line:0%
Yan Xing

00:33:33.000 --> 00:33:34.530 line:0%
is your fiancée's sister.

00:33:36.880 --> 00:33:37.600 line:0%
She

00:33:37.600 --> 00:33:39.200 line:0%
is clever.

00:33:39.560 --> 00:33:40.720 line:0%
She knew what I was doing

00:33:40.720 --> 00:33:41.880 line:0%
was to save her.

00:33:42.680 --> 00:33:44.880 line:0%
But whether she'll be my sister-in-law

00:33:45.000 --> 00:33:47.000 line:0%
depends on whether her third sister

00:33:47.360 --> 00:33:48.440 line:0%
has the courage

00:33:48.440 --> 00:33:50.560 line:0%
to marry me, Shen Du, as my wife.

00:33:58.600 --> 00:33:59.220 line:0%
This...

00:34:01.200 --> 00:34:03.400 line:0%
Thank you, Miss Yan, for risking your life to save us.

00:34:03.400 --> 00:34:04.400 line:0%
Please rise.

00:34:04.680 --> 00:34:05.920 line:0%
I work at the Ministry of Justice.

00:34:05.920 --> 00:34:07.200 line:0%
It was my duty.

00:34:07.200 --> 00:34:09.400 line:0%
But for your excellent case-solving skills,

00:34:09.400 --> 00:34:10.360 line:0%
we wouldn't be able

00:34:10.360 --> 00:34:11.680 line:0%
to make it back to see our families.

00:34:11.680 --> 00:34:12.600 line:0%
It's late at night.

00:34:12.600 --> 00:34:14.200 line:0%
Go back home now.

00:34:14.320 --> 00:34:15.780 line:0%
Thank you again, Miss Yan.

00:34:16.400 --> 00:34:16.930 line:0%
Let's go.

00:34:20.600 --> 00:34:21.400 line:0%
Miss.

00:34:24.880 --> 00:34:26.680 line:0%
Today I see how you solved a case.

00:34:26.680 --> 00:34:27.680 line:0%
You are so clever

00:34:27.680 --> 00:34:28.720 line:0%
and you didn't escape in the face of danger.

00:34:28.720 --> 00:34:29.720 line:0%
You saved my life.

00:34:30.880 --> 00:34:31.340 line:0%
Come up.

00:34:32.680 --> 00:34:34.470 line:0%
So I want you to be my teacher.

00:34:34.470 --> 00:34:35.930 line:0%
Please don't say no, Miss.

00:34:37.260 --> 00:34:38.320 line:0%
I'm still just

00:34:38.320 --> 00:34:40.070 line:0%
a scribe without a rank.

00:34:40.100 --> 00:34:41.600 line:0%
How can I be your teacher?

00:34:41.640 --> 00:34:42.430 line:0%
Besides,

00:34:42.430 --> 00:34:43.510 line:0%
your parents

00:34:43.510 --> 00:34:44.240 line:0%
won't allow

00:34:44.240 --> 00:34:46.170 line:0%
you to take a woman as your teacher.

00:34:46.280 --> 00:34:47.430 line:0%
I have no parents.

00:34:47.600 --> 00:34:48.640 line:0%
I was brought up

00:34:48.640 --> 00:34:50.030 line:0%
by the villagers in Yangui Mountain Village.

00:34:50.030 --> 00:34:50.950 line:0%
I want you to be my teacher.

00:34:50.950 --> 00:34:51.950 line:0%
Please accept me.

00:34:54.810 --> 00:34:56.620 line:0%
[Lu Chuichui, a secretariat of Ministry of Justice]

00:34:55.680 --> 00:34:56.400 line:0%
But she may not

00:34:56.400 --> 00:34:57.880 line:0%
want you to be his disciple.

00:34:57.880 --> 00:34:58.600 line:0%
Boy.

00:35:01.040 --> 00:35:01.840 line:0%
Miss.

00:35:02.680 --> 00:35:03.800 line:0%
Is that so?

00:35:05.840 --> 00:35:07.300 line:0%
Get in the carriage, Xing.

00:35:12.880 --> 00:35:13.520 line:0%
Let's go.

00:35:17.280 --> 00:35:17.880 line:0%
By the way.

00:35:17.880 --> 00:35:18.520 line:0%
How did you know

00:35:18.520 --> 00:35:19.360 line:0%
I was at the Imperial Security Bureau?

00:35:19.360 --> 00:35:20.600 line:0%
I got the news

00:35:20.600 --> 00:35:21.600 line:0%
from the clerk

00:35:21.600 --> 00:35:22.720 line:0%
in the shop near my house.

00:35:22.720 --> 00:35:23.560 line:0%
He said

00:35:23.600 --> 00:35:25.040 line:0%
his cousin's classmate's

00:35:25.040 --> 00:35:26.040 line:0%
cousin's sister-in-law

00:35:26.040 --> 00:35:27.360 line:0%
saw in Yangui Mountain Village

00:35:27.360 --> 00:35:28.520 line:0%
that some villagers

00:35:28.520 --> 00:35:30.080 line:0%
and a female scribe from the Ministry of Justice

00:35:30.080 --> 00:35:32.040 line:0%
were taken to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:35:32.040 --> 00:35:33.040 line:0%
So it was a female scribe

00:35:33.040 --> 00:35:34.480 line:0%
from the Ministry of Justice.

00:35:34.480 --> 00:35:36.010 line:0%
Who else could it be but you?

00:35:37.020 --> 00:35:37.640 line:0%
Well, it seems

00:35:37.640 --> 00:35:39.320 line:0%
that shop clerk

00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:42.500 line:0%
is more suited for the Ministry of Justice than you are.

00:35:43.240 --> 00:35:44.040 line:0%
At first, when I heard about it,

00:35:44.040 --> 00:35:45.320 line:0%
I was so worried.

00:35:45.480 --> 00:35:46.360 line:0%
But then I knew

00:35:46.360 --> 00:35:47.800 line:0%
you were there to investigate a case.

00:35:47.800 --> 00:35:48.610 line:0%
Then

00:35:48.630 --> 00:35:50.310 line:0%
I was not worried at all.

00:35:50.520 --> 00:35:51.400 line:0%
There's not any case

00:35:51.400 --> 00:35:52.560 line:0%
that you, Yan Xing,

00:35:52.560 --> 00:35:53.920 line:0%
can't solve.

00:35:54.400 --> 00:35:55.200 line:0%
Besides,

00:35:55.320 --> 00:35:56.240 line:0%
you know someone

00:35:56.240 --> 00:35:58.240 line:0%
from the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:36:02.840 --> 00:36:03.640 line:0%
Don't tell me

00:36:03.880 --> 00:36:04.600 line:0%
Shen Du

00:36:04.600 --> 00:36:06.130 line:0%
hasn't recognized you yet.

00:36:14.200 --> 00:36:15.980 line:0%
Is he blind or something?

00:36:19.330 --> 00:36:20.400 line:0%
Anyway, forget about that.

00:36:20.400 --> 00:36:22.530 line:0%
I think I'd better take you home first.

00:36:23.000 --> 00:36:24.000 line:0%
I'm not going home.

00:36:24.000 --> 00:36:25.720 line:0%
Just drop me off at the Ministry of Justice.

00:36:25.720 --> 00:36:27.120 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice?

00:36:27.280 --> 00:36:28.410 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:36:29.000 --> 00:36:31.960 line:0%
Tomorrow is the registration date for the female official examination?

00:36:31.960 --> 00:36:33.800 line:0%
The women in the Xiang'an City

00:36:33.800 --> 00:36:34.600 line:0%
all want to be like your third sister

00:36:34.600 --> 00:36:36.400 line:0%
who is a famous,

00:36:36.440 --> 00:36:37.560 line:0%
talented, elegant,

00:36:37.560 --> 00:36:39.440 line:0%
noble lady.

00:36:39.680 --> 00:36:41.360 line:0%
Only you are so determined

00:36:41.360 --> 00:36:42.640 line:0%
to become a female official.

00:36:42.640 --> 00:36:44.280 line:0%
You're already a female official.

00:36:44.280 --> 00:36:46.140 line:0%
I can't fall too far behind, can I?

00:36:46.280 --> 00:36:47.160 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:36:47.160 --> 00:36:48.840 line:0%
This year, I'll definitely become

00:36:48.840 --> 00:36:51.640 line:0%
a real female official of the Ministry of Justice.

00:36:51.640 --> 00:36:52.400 line:0%
Turn right ahead.

00:36:52.400 --> 00:36:53.880 line:0%
Go to the Ministry of Justice.

00:36:53.880 --> 00:36:54.680 line:0%
My Lord.

00:36:54.840 --> 00:36:57.240 line:0%
The assassin we sent has committed suicide on the spot.

00:36:57.240 --> 00:36:58.320 line:0%
Then

00:36:58.440 --> 00:36:59.840 line:0%
the battle between them two

00:36:59.840 --> 00:37:01.640 line:0%
will become more interesting.

00:37:04.040 --> 00:37:05.800 line:0%
The state preceptor made a final prophecy

00:37:05.800 --> 00:37:06.880 line:0%
before his death.

00:37:07.200 --> 00:37:08.960 line:0%
Have you found out what it was about?

00:37:08.960 --> 00:37:10.090 line:0%
It is said that

00:37:10.320 --> 00:37:12.120 line:0%
besides "The phoenix leads nine holy birds,"

00:37:12.120 --> 00:37:13.480 line:0%
and "peace reigns under heaven,"

00:37:13.480 --> 00:37:15.040 line:0%
there's another half to the prophecy.

00:37:15.040 --> 00:37:16.840 line:0%
But no one said what it was.

00:37:17.240 --> 00:37:18.560 line:0%
It seems no one knows.

00:37:18.760 --> 00:37:20.890 line:0%
On the night the state preceptor died,

00:37:21.760 --> 00:37:23.840 line:0%
White Ghost and Black Rakshasa

00:37:23.840 --> 00:37:25.300 line:0%
were both in the Ming Hall.

00:37:27.680 --> 00:37:28.400 line:0%
These two

00:37:28.400 --> 00:37:30.880 line:0%
are really unpredictable.

00:37:31.770 --> 00:37:34.880 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:37:34.710 --> 00:37:35.760 line:0%
What happened?

00:37:36.040 --> 00:37:36.920 line:0%
I am the sixth daughter of the Yan family.

00:37:36.920 --> 00:37:37.800 line:0%
Let me in.

00:37:46.240 --> 00:37:47.760 line:0%
In accordance with heaven's will and the times,

00:37:47.760 --> 00:37:49.080 line:0%
I have received this clear mandate.

00:37:49.080 --> 00:37:50.320 line:0%
The Yan family has a daughter

00:37:50.320 --> 00:37:51.680 line:0%
with a talent for poetry.

00:37:51.510 --> 00:37:54.210 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:37:51.760 --> 00:37:53.160 line:0%
She's good with words

00:37:53.200 --> 00:37:54.760 line:0%
and excellent at embroidery.

00:37:54.760 --> 00:37:56.120 line:0%
She is well-versed in classics and virtuous in conduct,

00:37:56.120 --> 00:37:57.600 line:0%
knowledgeable in both ancient and modern affairs.

00:37:57.600 --> 00:37:59.640 line:0%
Her reputation as a virtuous and talented lady

00:37:59.640 --> 00:38:01.080 line:0%
-is well known in the Xiang'an City.
-Mother.

00:38:01.080 --> 00:38:03.280 line:0%
I am greatly pleased to hear of this.

00:38:03.400 --> 00:38:06.160 line:0%
Now, Shen Du, Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau

00:38:06.160 --> 00:38:07.800 line:0%
is of marriageable age.

00:38:07.660 --> 00:38:11.200 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:38:07.920 --> 00:38:10.160 line:0%
A worthy fiancée should be chosen for him.

00:38:10.160 --> 00:38:12.920 line:0%
As the Yan family's daughter is of marriageable age,

00:38:12.920 --> 00:38:15.160 line:0%
she and Shen Du are a match made in heaven.

00:38:15.160 --> 00:38:16.440 line:0%
In doing a good deed,

00:38:16.520 --> 00:38:17.880 line:0%
I hereby

00:38:17.770 --> 00:38:19.460 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:38:17.880 --> 00:38:19.920 line:0%
request you to be man and wife in three days.

00:38:19.920 --> 00:38:20.720 line:0%
The end.

00:38:23.920 --> 00:38:24.840 line:0%
Dr. Yan.

00:38:24.880 --> 00:38:26.680 line:0%
Please take the imperial edict.

00:38:26.960 --> 00:38:27.880 line:0%
Shen Du?

00:38:30.370 --> 00:38:32.400 line:0%
I thank grand empress dowager for her goodwill.

00:38:30.440 --> 00:38:31.840 line:0%
[Yan Kuo, master of the Yan family]

00:38:36.360 --> 00:38:37.760 line:0%
Thank you.

00:38:38.880 --> 00:38:40.120 line:0%
Congratulations, Dr. Yan,

00:38:40.120 --> 00:38:41.720 line:0%
on educating Lady Caiwei so well

00:38:40.910 --> 00:38:42.550 line:0%
[Yan Caiwei, third daughter of the Yan family]

00:38:41.720 --> 00:38:45.050 line:0%
that she's become a virtuous noble lady famous in Xiang'an.

00:38:46.360 --> 00:38:48.160 line:0%
Oh, my Caiwei.

00:38:54.280 --> 00:38:55.480 line:0%
Caiwei cannot marry!

00:38:58.240 --> 00:39:00.040 line:0%
A girl's marriage

00:39:00.080 --> 00:39:01.840 line:0%
has always been decided by her parents

00:39:01.840 --> 00:39:03.360 line:0%
and arranged by matchmakers.

00:39:03.360 --> 00:39:04.440 line:0%
Moreover,

00:39:04.530 --> 00:39:07.800 line:0%
this decision is made by the grand empress dowager.

00:39:07.800 --> 00:39:09.400 line:0%
But he's White Ghost.

00:39:09.640 --> 00:39:11.520 line:0%
If our Caiwei marries him,

00:39:11.720 --> 00:39:12.520 line:0%
she...

00:39:13.000 --> 00:39:15.600 line:0%
She'll be miserable.

00:39:21.130 --> 00:39:22.620 line:0%
[Ms. Jin, Yan Kuo's concubine]

00:39:26.800 --> 00:39:30.160 line:0%
Life is so unpredictable.

00:39:31.460 --> 00:39:34.160 line:0%
This is beyond anyone's expectation.

00:39:35.560 --> 00:39:37.800 line:0%
It's so tragic.

00:39:50.560 --> 00:39:51.160 line:0%
Mother.

00:39:51.640 --> 00:39:53.040 line:0%
Why are staring at me?

00:39:54.120 --> 00:39:55.080 line:0%
People say

00:39:55.200 --> 00:39:57.000 line:0%
truly wise people look foolish.

00:39:57.520 --> 00:40:00.360 line:0%
Are you one of those people?

00:40:03.280 --> 00:40:04.720 line:0%
I always feel that I

00:40:04.880 --> 00:40:06.440 line:0%
have no ability and no status.

00:40:06.440 --> 00:40:08.520 line:0%
I gave birth to you and you're only a concubine's daughter.

00:40:08.520 --> 00:40:10.040 line:0%
and because of that, you're unwelcome.

00:40:10.040 --> 00:40:11.160 line:0%
That's why I've always wanted you to

00:40:11.160 --> 00:40:12.760 line:0%
learn from your third sister

00:40:12.760 --> 00:40:14.520 line:0%
to behave like a lady

00:40:14.680 --> 00:40:16.440 line:0%
so you marry into a good family in the future

00:40:16.440 --> 00:40:19.040 line:0%
and have a better life for the rest of your life.

00:40:19.320 --> 00:40:20.160 line:0%
Mother.

00:40:20.160 --> 00:40:21.480 line:0%
You know I don't like those things.

00:40:21.480 --> 00:40:22.320 line:0%
Yes.

00:40:22.880 --> 00:40:24.720 line:0%
I used to get angry too,

00:40:24.720 --> 00:40:26.480 line:0%
always blaming you for being stupid,

00:40:26.480 --> 00:40:28.140 line:0%
uneducated and incompetent.

00:40:29.840 --> 00:40:30.720 line:0%
But now,

00:40:31.480 --> 00:40:32.920 line:0%
I suddenly feel

00:40:33.040 --> 00:40:35.280 line:0%
being uneducated and incompetent is not bad.

00:40:35.280 --> 00:40:36.960 line:0%
Being uneducated and incompetent

00:40:36.960 --> 00:40:38.320 line:0%
is not really bad.

00:40:39.000 --> 00:40:41.530 line:0%
Mother, I'm not uneducated and incompetent.

00:40:43.840 --> 00:40:44.960 line:0%
Think about it.

00:40:45.180 --> 00:40:47.800 line:0%
There are so many young women in the Xiang'an City.

00:40:47.800 --> 00:40:49.600 line:0%
Why is your third sister

00:40:49.600 --> 00:40:51.660 line:0%
chosen by the grand empress dowager?

00:40:52.720 --> 00:40:53.560 line:0%
It's because

00:40:53.560 --> 00:40:55.920 line:0%
her talents manners are so exceptional.

00:40:56.070 --> 00:40:58.200 line:0%
The First Madam has been educating her since she was young.

00:40:58.200 --> 00:41:00.120 line:0%
Music, chess, calligraphy, painting, poetry, and prose,

00:41:00.120 --> 00:41:01.640 line:0%
she excels in all of them.

00:41:01.640 --> 00:41:03.720 line:0%
But who would have thought that now

00:41:04.040 --> 00:41:06.600 line:0%
She's going to marry White Ghost

00:41:06.600 --> 00:41:08.640 line:0%
and enter his hell.

00:41:09.800 --> 00:41:10.720 line:0%
Mother.

00:41:10.760 --> 00:41:11.600 line:0%
Shen Du

00:41:11.600 --> 00:41:13.080 line:0%
is the of grand commander of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:41:13.080 --> 00:41:14.800 line:0%
He's not as bad as you think.

00:41:17.320 --> 00:41:18.420 line:0%
Then do you think

00:41:18.520 --> 00:41:20.320 line:0%
the First Madam and your third sister

00:41:20.320 --> 00:41:23.650 line:0%
are just putting on an act with all their crying and fussing?

00:41:24.240 --> 00:41:25.040 line:0%
In short,

00:41:25.600 --> 00:41:27.960 line:0%
if your third sister marries him,

00:41:28.200 --> 00:41:30.400 line:0%
she will be

00:41:30.600 --> 00:41:31.280 line:0%
miserable,

00:41:31.300 --> 00:41:31.980 line:0%
painful,

00:41:32.010 --> 00:41:32.560 line:0%
anguished,

00:41:32.560 --> 00:41:33.600 line:0%
and tortured.